# Unoptimized source rasters — kept locally for re-running the image
# optimizer, but not committed/deployed (the site uses the .webp versions).
# Originals are also preserved in old_react_code/src/assets/.
assets/*.png
!assets/favicon-32.png
!assets/apple-touch-icon.png
assets/logo.svg
assets/logo_old.svg
